# T-Bank Keywords generation (K-TBANK-KEYWORDS-GENERATION-001)

## Rule

Third token of PDF `/Keywords` (`date | hash | TOKEN`) must match the bank generation for the **receipt face date**:

| Receipt date | Token |
|--------------|--------|
| **before** 10.07.2026 | `991` |
| **on/after** 10.07.2026 | `DOCS-2035` |

Implemented by `tbank_sbp_stealth._keywords_third_token` → `_patch_pdf_metadata` (all T-Bank channels via `tbank_channel_common`).

## Forbidden

- Always forcing `DOCS-2035` (or always `991`) regardless of date
- Putting `DOCS-2035` on a PDF dated before 10.07.2026 → Proton HARD FAKE
- Putting `991` on a PDF dated on/after 10.07.2026 → Proton HARD FAKE

## When Proton reports this

Fix the token vs date — do not spam regenerations with the same mismatch.
